            "introtext": "\t<p>Receive occasional emails with parish news, upcoming events, ministry opportunities, and important announcements to help you stay connected with the life of the parish.</p>\n<!-- Begin Constant Contact Active Forms -->\n<script>// <![CDATA[\nvar _ctct_m = \"06b9d6346338bdc94ca55bfe42823dac\";\n// ]]></script>\n<script id=\"signupScript\" src=\"//static.ctctcdn.com/js/signup-form-widget/current/signup-form-widget.min.js\" async=\"\" defer=\"defer\"></script>\n<!-- End Constant Contact Active Forms -->\n<p> </p>\n<!-- Begin Constant Contact Inline Form Code -->\n<div class=\"ctct-inline-form\" data-form-id=\"d28bde00-32b3-49c6-884d-dc5e994dff39\"> </div>\n<!-- End Constant Contact Inline Form Code -->",
